webtray (1.0.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release:
    - one tray icon per configured URL, each with the site's favicon;
      clicking opens/hides the page in a shared QtWebEngine window
    - drop-in URL files watched in ~/.config/webtray/urls
    - optional custom icon and custom title per URL (tray menu)
    - context menu at the panel edge below the icon, HiDPI-correct
    - crisp tray icons on HiDPI panels (native pixels on X11)
    - per-URL geometry, zoom and last page remembered; system UI font
    - autostart via ~/.config/autostart, enabled by default
    - single instance, configuration dialog, about dialog

 -- Dieter Steinwedel <deb@hifidom.com>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:15:00 +0100
